  << /ActualText (Slides 4 \046 5 \055 Can you provide more context and show the current journey for expecting parents in the UK\077 For example\054 the NHS provides an antenatal \046 postnatal journey \050show the journey\051\056 What advice do parents receive leading up to the birth\077 What is the \030current state\031 journey\077 Where does the expecting father get involved in this journey\077\240 What about the NCT \050National Childbirth Trust\051 course for both parents\077 Where does this happen in the current journey\077\240\nBy showing this journey\054 it will help provide context for your project and help to communicate where and why your service intervention is needed\056\240 For example\054 is there a lot of support available for mums\077\240 but less for dads\077 This can be shown on the current state journey\056\240 Do dads begin to feel excluded before the baby is even born\077 Show us why this is\056 And why is it important that dads are involved early\077 \050you did some research on this\051\056\240 Create a new slide that shows the current state journey of expecting parents\056 This should go earlier in the presentation \023 to show the context for the problem you are addressing \050to provide ways for fathers to be more involved in caring for their baby at an early stage\056\240\n)
