1868 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\073\230\032 \250\342Sp\245\367\312\345\037\n\250\175\014\n\021\354\057 Royal College of Art\010RCA\t\204f\037\014\356M\t\000y\325\032y\356\000\2016\134\014\363\250\342\000\013\245\367\345\312\345\037\002\n\021\354\204\000B\202\013\032\nGuidebook\n \020\301\072\370\03220 \327 20 cm\n\314bSp\n \205u\03216u\n\nRecording Book\n\020\301\072\370\03220 \327 20 cm\n\314bSp\n \205u\03234u\n\nBooklet\nA4\072\370\230u\010\044\052H\054\004Sp\000\375\014q2\375\t\n\314bSp\n\n4\056Challenge Cards\nq24 aG\n\314bSp\n\317 \24611 \327 14 cm\n\nD\366\055D\n\206\205\271\204\310\014\271\277\250\206\343\047\364H\234\002\n\021\354\014\033\375\050 7\01015\345 M\214\0206\134v\326\047\014\340d\363\250\342\000\013\032\n \047\202\245\367\057\032\021\037\n \057\046\375\037\0507\01015\345M\214\0206\134\037\n \202\234\357\345\204\335\014\047\202\300H\366\031\000\201n\244\242Uv\320\244\000\310\207\366\037\n\n\346\026\014\356M\270 P\050\214\305\242\271\017\330\241\t\000\310n\232\014\137\042\316\2509nD\366\055\204\276\241\205\271\331\021\354\000\233\372\256\014\014\033\375\050\2476\204\227\204\014\366\2760\203\175\204\020\301H\234\002\n\1368\037\042\014\037\205\250\204\336\015\001\n\n\135\175\014\nJiayi Liu\n\n\n\nHi\054\nI hope you\047re doing well\056\nWe are students from the Royal College of Art\054 and we\047re looking for a local print shop to produce several items for our graduation project\056 We\047d like to ask for an estimated quotation and turnaround time\056\nOur printing requirements are\072\n1\056 Guidebook\n Finished size\072 20 \327 20 cm\n Double\055sided printing\n16 inner pages\n\n2\056 Recording Book\n Finished size\072 20 \327 20 cm\n Double\055sided printing\n34 inner pages\n\n3\056 Booklet\n A4 folded leaflet\n Two versions\054 one copy of each \0502 copies in total\051\n Double\055sided printing\n\n4\056 Challenge Cards\n24 cards\n Double\055sided printing\n Approx\056 11 \327 14 cm each\n\nI\047ve attached a preview of the designs to give you an idea of the content\056\nOur deadline is to collect everything by 15 July\054 so we\047d like to ask\072\n Could you provide an estimated quotation\077\n Would it be possible to complete the printing before 15 July\077\n If so\054 when would you need the final print\055ready files\077\n\nWe haven\047t finalised the paper stock or binding methods yet\054 so we\047d really appreciate any recommendations you may have based on the attached designs\056 We\047d love to achieve the best possible result while keeping the project within our budget\056\n\n\nThank you very much\054 and I look forward to hearing from you\056\nBest regards\054\nJiayi Liu)
     /K [ 866 ]
     /P 1869 0 R
     /Pg 136 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
