2012 0 obj
  << /ActualText (WHY YOU NEED US\nMost new fathers want to be involved in caring for their baby \024 but don\047t know where to begin\056 The information\054 the guidance\054 and the confidence that comes from knowing what you\047re doing never quite reaches them\056 They end up on the sidelines\054 not by choice\054 but by default\056\nIn the earliest months of a child\047s life\054 physical care is everything\056 Feeding is where that care happens most \024 daily\054 repeatedly\054 and up close\056 It\047s routine enough to practise\054 and hands\055on enough to build a real connection\056 For a dad looking for a way in\054 it\047s the most natural place to start\056\nPapaBite is a physical toolkit that lets dads learn by doing\056 Through the weaning journey\054 fathers build real feeding skills\054 create a lasting record of their child\047s growth\054 and collect moments with their baby that wouldn\047t have happened otherwise\056)
     /K [ 938 ]
     /P 2013 0 R
     /Pg 136 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
