2026 0 obj
  << /ActualText (BACKGROUND\nEN\nResearch consistently shows that fathers\031 early involvement benefits children\031s cognitive\054 social and emotional development\054 while also improving the wellbeing of the whole family\056\nHowever\054 despite the growing recognition of fathers\031 role in parenting\054 most early years services\054 information and products are still designed primarily for mothers\056 This leaves many fathers without clear guidance\054 practical opportunities or the confidence to take an active role in caring for their babies\056\n\055\207\n\047\317\024vh\016\0146\262\212\351\302\016iP\020\177\307\013\014\212\t\251\216\303\333\077\345\204\244\345\001\076\032\305\037\321U\014\014\366\137\375\320Gt\052\266\255\204\217I\002\n6\014\014\075\2416\262\050\262\077\055\204\315\201\047\362\020\020\3270\315\306\014\260\t\204\260\037\077g\244\015\241\001\341oD\220\312\247\301\276\241\315\073\201\345\315\262\0728\303\0507\002\340d\014\270\0326\262\072O\005p\204\007\374\001\236\365\072\032\016\262\077\341\303\014\015\345S\224\345\202U\000\313\302\016\235\235\204g\244\002\n\n\n\nTHE CHALLENGE\nEN\nFor many first\055time fathers\054 the challenge is not a lack of willingness\024it is a lack of support\056\nWithout accessible resources\054 practical experience and personalised guidance\054 fathers often become observers rather than confident caregivers during one of the most important stages of their child\031s development\056\n\055\207\n\371\216\270\032\260K88\014\000\014\037c\204\356\230v\015\057\072O\302\016\017\077\014\014\057\072O\057\001\002\n\072\021\002\010\352\361\204D\220\001\236\365\072\032\214\052\047\026\007\374\014\177\326\354\050iP\020\177\000s\056\2046\265\014\364\271\023\020\072\034\301\302\005\035\014\014\015\057\352\341\204g\244\005\002\n\n\nWHY PAPA BITE\077\nEN\nBecause confidence doesn\031t come from reading\056\nIt comes from doing\056\nPapaBite transforms everyday weaning moments into guided learning experiences\054 helping fathers develop practical skills\054 build confidence and establish their own caregiving style\056\n\055\207\n\340\072\262\077\341\303v\015\057\140\005\373\372\313\204\014\014\057\050\236\365\055\371\173\204\002\nPapaBite \006\317\051\204\205\337\202\173l\026\072\252\217\020\333\204f\140S\214\014\056\2516\262\050\037\236g\244\055\357\057\200\375\001\372\313\341\303\014vb\020\136\216\352\361\204\262\077\271\017\002\n\n\nWHAT IS PAPA BITE\077\nEN\nPapaBite is a father\055first parenting brand designed for the weaning stage\056\nThrough bite\055sized activities\054 evidence\055based guidance and everyday practice\054 PapaBite helps first\055time fathers learn by doing\054 making caregiving more accessible\054 engaging and enjoyable\056\n\055\207\nPapaBite \057\000\052\023\072\260K88S \204\262\077\301L\014Z\046t\077\205\337\202\1736\265\002\n\032\307\173\317\026\373\241\001\321f\262\077\345\306\214\037\236\202\173\236\365\014\056\2516\262\050L\250\055f\140\014\251g\244\330\227\364\240\200U\001\t\243\024E\341\341\303\002\n)
